		"The racquet sports covered in this course are tennis and pickleball. This course offers instruction in basic strokes, history, rules, etiquette, and terminology of outdoor racquet sports (tennis and pickleball). Students participate in a wide range of assessments designed to enhance physical fitness (strength, endurance, nutrition, flexibility, body composition, stress). Offered annually during fall and spring semester."
